            <ArticleTitle>Effects of coronary artery aneurysms on intracoronary flow velocity dynamics in Kawasaki disease.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>873-5</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>In coronary artery aneurysms associated with Kawasaki disease, a significant decrease in coronary flow velocity together with an abnormal flow profile and a reduction in coronary flow reserve were observed, and were significantly correlated with the size of the aneurysm. These results suggest that coronary arterial aneurysms impair coronary circulation.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
